          <div style={{ fontSize: 13, color: colors.textMuted, marginBottom: 14, lineHeight: 1.5 }}>
            Opt in to privately share your savings for the chance to win a Mac Mini!
          </div>
          <div style={{ marginBottom: 8 }}>
            <input
              type="text"
